an="1">0.060</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.592</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">.006</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Anticipated level of resistance from physicians pre-implementation</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;0.097</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.056</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02013;0.264</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">.091</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>